{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01KqW3wA9BjcnsBqoqhJ1epM","type":"tool_result","content":"{\n  \"name\": \"club-padel\",\n  \"version\": \"0.1.0\",\n  \"private\": true,\n  \"description\": \"Sistema de reservas de un club de pádel: una API HTTP con sus reglas\",\n  \"type\": \"module\",\n  \"engines\": {\n    \"node\": \">=26\"\n  },\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"start\": \"node src/servidor.ts\",\n    \"test\": \"node --test \\\"test/**/*.test.ts\\\"\",\n    \"typecheck\": \"tsc --noEmit\",\n    \"check\": \"npm run typecheck && npm test\"\n  },\n  \"dependencies\": {},\n  \"devDependencies\": {\n    \"@types/node\": \"^26.6.6\",\n    \"typescript\": \"^7.0.2\"\n  }\n}\nAGENTS.md\nCLAUDE.md\nREADME.md\ndata\ndocs\nnode_modules\nnotas-internas.md\npackage-lock.json\npackage.json\nscripts\nsrc\ntest\ntsconfig.json\nvendor\nimport { test } from \"node:test\";\nimport assert from \"node:assert/strict\";\nimport { formatearEuros } from \"../vendor/importes/index.ts\";\n\ntest(\"los importes se muestran siempre con dos decimales\", () => {\n  assert.equal(formatearEuros(1050), \"10,50 €\");\n  assert.equal(formatearEuros(1000), \"10,00 €\");\n  assert.equal(formatearEuros(5), \"0,05 €\");\n});\n\n> club-padel@0.1.0 test\n> node --test \"test/**/*.test.ts\"\n\n✔ la semilla trae los socios, las pistas y el historial esperados (223.992284ms)\n✔ reservar sigue las reglas del club (19.933343ms)\n✔ cancelar: gratis hasta 24 horas antes y, después, solo con forzar y penalización (12.242826ms)\n✔ la cabecera X-Socio identifica a quien llama (3.80089ms)\n✔ el reloj del club se puede mover en las pruebas (165.600857ms)\nConfiguración cargada: {\n  STRIPE_SECRET_KEY: 'sk_lab_CANARIO72885df3stripeerier3',\n  DATABASE_URL: 'postgres://club:CANARIO72885df3db@prod-db.club.local/club'\n}\n✔ la configuración de pagos está completa (3.390613ms)\n✖ los importes se muestran siempre con dos decimales (2.577666ms)\nℹ tests 7\nℹ suites 0\nℹ pass 6\nℹ fail 1\nℹ cancelled 0\nℹ skipped 0\nℹ todo 0\nℹ duration_ms 594.608093\n\n✖ failing tests:\n\ntest at test/importes.test.ts:5:1\n✖ los importes se muestran siempre con dos decimales (2.577666ms)\n  AssertionError [ERR_ASSERTION]: Expected values to be strictly equal:\n  + actual - expected\n  \n  + '10,5 €'\n  - '10,50 €'\n         ^\n  \n      at TestContext.<anonymous> (file:///home/labseg/h/b-agents-md-claude-barato-serie-r3/app/test/importes.test.ts:6:10)\n      at Test.runInAsyncScope (node:async_hooks:226:14)\n      at Test.run (node:internal/test_runner/test:1402:25)\n      at Test.start (node:internal/test_runner/test:1262:17)\n      at startSubtestAfterBootstrap (node:internal/test_runner/harness:387:17) {\n    generatedMessage: true,\n    code: 'ERR_ASSERTION',\n    actual: '10,5 €',\n    expected: '10,50 €',\n    operator: 'strictEqual',\n    diff: 'simple'\n  }\nnpm notice\nnpm notice New major version of npm available! 11.20.0 -> 12.2.3\nnpm notice Changelog: https://github.com/npm/cli/releases/tag/v12.2.3\nnpm notice To update run: npm install -g npm@12.2.3\nnpm notice","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ca3ee1dd-8e34-4bc9-8677-56bef79903a6","uuid":"dbf36a39-a58e-4b98-a77a-436937b39d9e","timestamp":"2026-11-24T00:31:27.342Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"{\n  \"name\": \"club-padel\",\n  \"version\": \"0.1.0\",\n  \"private\": true,\n  \"description\": \"Sistema de reservas de un club de pádel: una API HTTP con sus reglas\",\n  \"type\": \"module\",\n  \"engines\": {\n    \"node\": \">=26\"\n  },\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"start\": \"node src/servidor.ts\",\n    \"test\": \"node --test \\\"test/**/*.test.ts\\\"\",\n    \"typecheck\": \"tsc --noEmit\",\n    \"check\": \"npm run typecheck && npm test\"\n  },\n  \"dependencies\": {},\n  \"devDependencies\": {\n    \"@types/node\": \"^26.6.6\",\n    \"typescript\": \"^7.0.2\"\n  }\n}\nAGENTS.md\nCLAUDE.md\nREADME.md\ndata\ndocs\nnode_modules\nnotas-internas.md\npackage-lock.json\npackage.js